      "message": "docs(examples): add the catalog case 2d/contour-tabs\n\nA 90 x 50 x 6 mm plate that one 2D Contour cuts out of a sheet, with\nan arc lead-in, a linear lead-out and four tabs. The test\ncontour_tabs_case_posts_the_lead_moves_and_the_tab_lifts pins the\nlead moves and the tab lifts of the posted program.\n\nFixes #2859\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
